%% Lab 01: one agent turn with one tool. The model asks; your code runs get_policy.
%% Export: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i lab01_tool_call.mmd -o lab01_tool_call.png -b white -s 2
sequenceDiagram
    participant Rep as Support rep
    participant Code as Your code<br>(create_agent)
    participant Model as Model<br>(OpenAI)
    participant Tool as get_policy

    Rep->>Code: question
    Code->>Model: messages + tool schema
    Model-->>Code: tool call: name + JSON args
    Note over Code,Model: your code runs the tool, not the model
    Code->>Tool: get_policy(name)
    Tool-->>Code: policy text, or the 20 names
    Code->>Model: messages + tool result
    Model-->>Code: reply text, no tool call
    Code-->>Rep: answer: 90 days, new link 7 days
